"3.0 9.7 16.4 28.4 36.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » diye Cibrîlin zikri geçmiş olmasından dolayı ânifen ıhtar ettiğimiz vechile «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 23.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » fasılasının tekrariyle oraya yapılan ircaı nazar dahi buna dakık bir işaret olmuştur. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"456\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 455.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.7 61.6 68.3 68.3 68.3 75.0 96.0 96.0 108.7 116.3 128.3 128.3 144.0 162.0 162.0 182.3 198.7 198.7 198.7 215.3 215.3 231.0 237.7 253.6 260.3 267.7 267.7 274.6 290.3 290.3 300.7 319.6 319.6 326.3 326.3 330.7 338.3 354.0 354.0 364.6 372.7 372.7 379.6 386.3 403.6 417.0 428.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 75.0 108.7 116.3 144.0 170.3 170.3 182.3 237.7 260.3 274.6 307.6 307.6 379.6 386.3 439.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>","y":0}